./manuscript/MANUSCRIPT_SUBMISSION.md:302:6. Pérez de Isla L, Alonso R, Mata N, et al. Predicting cardiovascular events in familial hypercholesterolemia: the SAFEHEART Registry. *Circulation.* 2017;135:2133–2144. doi:10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.116.024541.
