./debate/evidence/julius-spec-kit/spec_kit_execution_report.md:30:### Compact SAFEHEART experiment
./debate/evidence/julius-spec-kit/spec_kit_execution_report.md:36:Under the native `NOT_EVALUABLE` policy, SAFEHEART and FH-Risk-Score cannot be scored. An explicitly declared nmol/L divided by 2.15 sensitivity conversion was therefore used only for exploratory execution.
