177-To predict the 10-year ASCVD risk, a regression equation was 
178:generated using the log HR (beta coefficient from the Cox 
179-regression) for each risk factor. Risk categories were generated 
180-for continuous variables (age, HDL-C and LDL-C). The pres-
181:ence of each predictor, weighted by its beta coefficient, was 
182-combined in the formula. The overall 10-year ASCVD probability 
183-included in the equation was generated using the Kaplan-Meier 
184-estimate. In addition to the regression formula, we derived an 
185:associated simple point chart using the same beta-coefficients. 
186-Further details of the model validation and performance can be 
187:obtained in Methods in the Data Supplement.
