477-Conclusions
478-In conclusion, not all FH patients present the same risk
479-of CVD. Age, HDL-C, gender, hypertension, and smoking
480-are important independent predictors of CVD risk. We have
481-developed a novel tool combining these independent risk
482-factors to help predict the CVD risk in this population of
483:patients. As with any risk score, validation in other
484-populations would be important to conﬁrm its clinical
485-usefulness. Despite this, the Montreal-FH-SCORE signiﬁ-
486-cantly stratiﬁes patients in higher and lower CVD groups.
