./debate/steps/step-000/r1b/grok.md:86:Lp(a) threshold **105** versus Spec Kit **50**. I do not know the unit of `d.lpa`. DATA-INVENTORY.md lists `lpa_chem`, `pre_lpa`, `lpa_i0` and does not state units. 105 nmol/L is a common stand-in for ~50 mg/dL; it is also a unit error if `d.lpa` is already mg/dL. Nothing in the delivered pack would fail either way.
