 The Montreal-FH-SCORE: A new score to predict
cardiovascular events in familial
hypercholesterolemia
Martine Paquette, MSc, Robert Dufour, MD, MSc, Alexis Baass, MD, MSc *
Nutrition, Metabolism and Atherosclerosis Clinic, Institut de recherches cliniques de Montr /C19eal, Montreal, Qu /C19ebec,
Canada (Drs Paquette, Dufour , Baass); Department of Nutrition, Universit /C19e de Montr /C19eal, Montreal, Qu /C19ebec, Canada
